  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Wang Tao (Chinese: 汪滔; pinyin: Wāng Tāo; born 1980), better known as Frank Wang, is a  Chinese aerospace engineer and businessman. He is the founder and CEO of the Shenzhen-based technology company DJI, the world's largest manufacturer of commercial drones. As of December 2020, he has a net worth of US$4.8 billion.\n\n",
    "sourceId": "wikipedia-en",
